{"question": "Kích thước ngưỡng tối thiểu của áp xe răng trên siêu âm POCUS để chỉ định phẫu thuật dẫn lưu là bao nhiêu mm?", "claim": "Kết quả siêu âm POCUS cho thấy kích thước ngưỡng 0,45 cm hoặc lớn hơn có thể liên quan đến nhu cầu cần phẫu thuật dẫn lưu áp xe răng.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Tài liệu nội bộ về lập chương trình nha khoa đề cập đến việc đào tạo chẩn đoán và khám sàng lọc các tình huống cấp cứu nha khoa trong cộng đồng."}], "conversation": {"history": []}, "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Prior small case series in the dental literature have shown that ultrasound can detect odontogenic abscesses [4]. However, this is the first study to describe POCUS findings in children with dental abscess, determined by a pediatric emergency physician. Moreover, all children in our study had a POCUS diagnosis confirmed by an oromaxillofacial specialist, and all were followed through hospitalization. Our study demonstrated that a cutoff of approximately 0.45 cm yields a sensitivity of 72.7% and specificity of 69%, indicating that abscesses measuring 0.45 cm or greater may be associated with need for surgical drainage."}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q2", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Table 2"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q3", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Characteristics and results of included studies"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q4", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Authors | Study type/number of patients/level of VSC | Groups | Laser (nm) + photosensitizer | Protocol aPDT | Study observation—time | Results"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q5", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "5. Ciarcia et al. [19] | RCT 39 patients | G1 = 13 G2 = 13 G3 = 13 G1-aPDT G2- tongue scraper G3- aPDT i scraper | 660 nm methylene blue 0,005% | P = 400 mW E = 36 J t = 90 s P = 1039.4 mW/cm2 density E = 93.5 J/cm2 4 irradiated points, distance: 2 cm, for 2 min | 1 session, immediately after the treatment 1 week 14 days 30 days (VSC level) | Directly after the treatment the significant reduction in VSC was observed No data available after 7, 14, and 30 days"}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Dental Abscess on POCUS: A Retrospective Case Series Analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "Discussion"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Effectiveness of lasers and aPDT in elimination of intraoral halitosis: a systematic review based on clinical trials", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Results of individual studies"]}]}
